# Assembled outputs are gitignored by the root *.bin rule; the probes the
# CI golden suite boots (tests/probe_golden.rs) are whitelisted so a clean
# checkout runs without vasm. cc5/cc6 stay local (race-boundary
# demonstrators, not in the golden set) and cc7 must never be committed
# (it embeds a chip-RAM dump of a running demo).
!test.bin
!ddfprobe.bin
!ddfprobe-diw1.bin
!ddfprobe-toggle.bin
!ddfprobe-cc.bin
!ddfprobe-cc3.bin
!ddfprobe-cc4.bin
!ddfprobe-sprbar.bin
!ddfprobe-sprbar2.bin
!ddfprobe-sotb.bin
!ddfprobe-sotb2.bin
!ddfprobe-agaorigin.bin
!agashres-sprites.bin
